597
00:39:02,670 --> 00:39:04,050
Do you believe I murdered Joffrey?

598
00:39:04,050 --> 00:39:05,230
No, my lord.

599
00:39:06,630 --> 00:39:07,820
You didn't?

600
00:39:08,070 --> 00:39:10,470
No. Gods, no.

601
00:39:10,670 --> 00:39:12,650
The world is a better place without him,

602
00:39:12,650 --> 00:39:14,320
but I had nothing to do with it.

603
00:39:15,650 --> 00:39:17,030
I would like to think

604
00:39:17,030 --> 00:39:19,330
