607
00:39:26,390 --> 00:39:28,320
Trial in a fortnight.

608
00:39:28,930 --> 00:39:31,150
Have they announced the judges yet?

609
00:39:33,840 --> 00:39:36,640
-Your father.  -Of course.

610
00:39:37,460 --> 00:39:39,070
Mace Tyrell.

611
00:39:39,730 --> 00:39:42,970
Who will vote exactly as my father tells him to vote.

612
00:39:43,000 --> 00:39:45,070
And Prince Oberyn of Dorne.

613
00:39:45,140 --> 00:39:46,410
Oberyn?

614
00:39:47,900 --> 00:39:49,480
Give it to my father.

615
00:39:49,730 --> 00:39:52,380
He never fails to take advantage of a family tragedy.

616
00:39:52,380 --> 00:39:55,670
I'm supposed to get a list of names from you, my lord.

617
00:39:55,780 --> 00:39:58,600
Anyone who might testify on your behalf.

618
